Package: NOVA
Type: Package
Title: Neural Output Visualization and Analysis
Version: 0.2.0
Description: A dynamical-systems toolkit for neuronal network state analysis from
    Multi-Electrode Array (MEA) recordings. Builds on Principal Component
    Analysis (PCA) trajectory plotting, heatmap generation, and variable
    importance analysis with a 'nova_dynamics' module that quantifies how
    networks move through latent state space: trajectory geometry (velocity,
    tortuosity, directional persistence), state-transition matrices, trajectory
    similarity (Dynamic Time Warping and Frechet distance), dynamical-regime
    detection, occupancy landscapes, and a rule-based natural-language
    interpretation layer. Provides publication-ready visualizations with
    flexible customization options for neuroscience research applications.
